window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>From number-one worldwide best-selling fantasy author Morgan Rice comes a long-anticipated science-fiction series. </p> <p>SETI has received a signal from an alien civilization. Is there time to save the world?</p> <p>In the aftermath of SETI’s receiving the signal, 13-year-old Kevin realizes he is the only one who can save the world. But is there time? What must he do?</p> <p>And what do the aliens plan next?</p> <p>Audiobook three in the series will be available soon.</p> <p>Also available are Morgan Rice’s many series in the fantasy genre, including <i>A Quest of Heroes</i> (audiobook one in the Sorcerer's Ring series).</p>"; 
